      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CG · 00 Setup\nCreates the two Data Tables used by the content workflows. Safe to re-run: existing tables are kept (createIfNotExists).\n\nRun it from the editor (**Run Setup**) or let `scripts/setup.sh` call `POST /webhook/content/setup` (X-API-Key) after import.\n\n- **content_runs**: one row per generation run (inputs, diversity choices, models, quality, timing, cost). Read by the diversity planner.\n- **content_errors**: one row per failed execution, written by the error handler.",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 224
      }
